{
  "$schema": "../data/component-spec-schema.json",
  "component": "section-header",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "status": "draft",
  "layer": "molecule",
  "tags": [
    "content",
    "molecules",
    "block-kopf"
  ],
  "anatomy": {
    "rootElement": ".nc-section-header",
    "slots": [
      {
        "name": "badges",
        "selector": ".nc-section-header__badges",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Badge-Zeile (.nc-badge-row mit .nc-label) ueber dem Kicker."
      },
      {
        "name": "label",
        "selector": ".nc-section-header__label",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Kicker (Dachzeile, Monospace in Versalien)."
      },
      {
        "name": "title",
        "selector": ".nc-section-header__title",
        "required": true,
        "description": "Ueberschrift (h2, per heading_level auch h1/h3)."
      },
      {
        "name": "subtitle",
        "selector": ".nc-section-header__subtitle",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Lead."
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      "Der geteilte Kopf der Website-Bloecke: neo_fe:block-header rendert Badges -> Kicker -> Headline -> Lead; rund 20 Bloecke binden ihn ein.",
      "Die Badge-Zeile ist .nc-badge-row (05-atoms/_badge-row.scss, Hilfsklasse ohne eigenes Recipe) mit .nc-section-header__badges fuer den Abstand.",
      "--flush nimmt den Abstand nach unten weg — fuer Flex-/Grid-Eltern mit eigenem gap (text-media, form-block, accordion-block, text-cta).",
      "Hoechstbreite --fnd-prose-max-width (72ch); --center und --right richten auch die Badge-Zeile mit aus."
    ]
  },
  "api": null,
  "variants": {
    "alignment": {
      "label": "Ausrichtung",
      "description": "Textausrichtung des Kopfs",
      "values": [
        {
          "value": "left",
          "cssModifier": null,
          "default": false,
          "label": "left"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "cssModifier": "nc-section-header--center",
          "default": false,
          "label": "center"
        },
        {
          "value": "right",
          "cssModifier": "nc-section-header--right",
          "default": false,
          "label": "right"
        }
      ]
    },
    "spacing": {
      "label": "Abstand",
      "description": "Abstand zum Folgeinhalt",
      "values": [
        {
          "value": "standard",
          "cssModifier": null,
          "default": false,
          "label": "standard"
        },
        {
          "value": "flush",
          "cssModifier": "nc-section-header--flush",
          "default": false,
          "label": "flush"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "states": {
    "supported": [
      "default"
    ],
    "interactive": false,
    "rules": []
  },
